ui-screens/app-logic.md-206-**Patient unavailable** (D-51)
ui-screens/app-logic.md-207-- **Automatic** when the patient side fails (§5, state 9), whenever detected — the partner's reason is stored; no sheet. The case goes on hold and the system retries it by hangup cause; an invalid number is not retried (CW-B2). Nothing goes to Ops.
ui-screens/app-logic.md-208-- **By the doctor** only in 7d (result not received); state 6 has no Unavailable (D-58 pt 23). **Unavailable** opens the reason sheet "Mark patient unavailable" (D-75): Didn't answer · Not reachable · Wrong number. Choosing a reason closes the case at once (it is the confirmation); × backs out with no change. **The reason is saved with the case** for Ops monitoring (D-73).
ui-screens/app-logic.md-209-- Status card "Patient unavailable" with a neutral icon; medicines keep their status (Pending stays Pending).
